### E2E Test Results
{{with .Outcome}}
<p><strong>Lifecycle:</strong> {{.Overall}} | <strong>Infrastructure:</strong> {{.Infrastructure}} | <strong>Tests:</strong> {{.Tests}} | <strong>Native reports:</strong> {{.Reports}} | <strong>Cleanup:</strong> {{.Cleanup}} | <strong>Maintenance required:</strong> {{.MaintenanceRequired}}</p>
<p><strong>Selection:</strong> {{.Requested}} → {{.Resolved}} | <strong>Workers:</strong> {{.Workers}} | <strong>Executed:</strong> {{.Counts.Executed}}</p>
<p><strong>Trusted SHA:</strong> {{.Source.Dispatch.WorkflowSHA}} | <strong>Invocation:</strong> {{.Source.Dispatch.RunID}}/{{.Source.Dispatch.RunAttempt}} | <strong>PR:</strong> {{.Source.PRNumber}}</p>
<p><strong>Diagnostics:</strong> {{.Diagnostics}} | <strong>Artifact:</strong> {{.Artifact}} | <strong>Publication:</strong> {{.Publication}}</p>
{{end}}

<p><strong>Test commit:</strong> {{public .Commit}} | <strong>Controller commit:</strong> {{public .ControllerCommit}} | <strong>Total duration:</strong> {{public .Duration}}</p>
{{if .ControllerDigest}}<p><strong>Controller image digest:</strong> {{public .ControllerDigest}}</p>
{{end}}<p><strong>Controller resources:</strong> {{public .Resources}}</p>
{{if .LogsUnavailable}}<p><strong>Controller logs:</strong> unavailable</p>
{{end}}
{{if .Omitted}}<p>{{.Omitted}} additional spec rows omitted from this bounded summary. See safely exported evidence for details.</p>
{{end}}<table>
<thead><tr><th>Suite</th><th>Result</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Suites}}<tr>
<td><details>
<summary>{{public .Name}} — {{.Passed}} passed, {{.Failed}} failed{{if .Skipped}}, {{.Skipped}} skipped{{end}}{{if .Pending}}, {{.Pending}} pending{{end}}</summary>
<ul>
{{range .Specs}}<li>{{.Result}} · {{public .Name}} ({{public .Duration}})</li>
{{end}}</ul>
</details></td>
<td>{{.Result}}</td><td>{{public .Duration}}</td>
</tr>
{{end}}</tbody>
</table>
